    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111700" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλάω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Pl.</u>
			784
		</span></i>, impf.
		3sg.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					1376
				</span></i>
			: fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλάσω [ᾰ</span>], 
				Dor.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλασσῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					5.148
				</span></i>
			 (Ahrens, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλασῶ</span> codd.):
				aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφλᾰσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VC</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			, poet. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλάσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					10.68
				</span></i>
			, 
				Dor.
			 opt. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλάσσαιμι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					5.150
				</span></i>
			 (Ahrens, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλάσαιμι</span> codd.):—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφλάσθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			 l. c., etc.; pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέφλασμαι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1425.351
			</span></i>:— 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θλάω</span>
			, <i>crush,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ νιν φλάσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
				</span></i>
			 l. c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουλύπουν φλάσασα ἐσθιέτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Superf.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>VC</u>
				2
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφλα ἐν τῇ θυεία . . ὀπὸν καὶ
					σχῖνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					718
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλῶσι τἀντικνήμια</span> ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				784
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφλα με</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					1376
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
			</span></i> ll. cc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσι κακοῖσιν ἡμᾶς [τὰς γυναῖκας]
					φλῶσιν . . ἅνδρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			(lyr.). </div>
